            "pk": "17928848756863083",
            "text": "🌟🚀 Astana Hub, in partnership with Silkroad Innovation Hub, with the support of ICRIAP, the World Bank, and the FPIP project, is launching the ALCHEMISTX & SILICON VALLEY RESIDENCY program!\n\nThis 5-month journey is designed to help high-potential startups from Central Asia and neighboring regions to enter the US market. \n\n📍 Location: Bay Area, California\n💻 Format: In-person and online workshops and meetings\n🌍 Eligible Countries: Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Uzbekistan, Tajikistan, Turkmenistan, Turkey, Mongolia, Azerbaijan, and Georgia!\n\n💼 Requirements:\n• Focus on B2B sales;\n• 5-month to the program;\n• Existing client base;\n• Legal entities of participants must be registered in the Republic of Kazakhstan or AIFC;\n• Fluent English level.\n\n🦄✨ Ready to scale your startup to new heights and conquer the US market? Let’s make unicorn dreams a reality!\n\n❗Apply via the link in bio."
